      <p class="muted">Edge% = <b>trigger probability</b>: itne % rounds me engine house-behtar result chunta hai, baqi pure-random. Ye "house itna kamayega" NAHI hai. 0 = kabhi tilt nahi. Sirf casino \u2014 sports par kabhi nahi.</p>
